"<p>SaaSBase provides integrated observability tools:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Interactive Web Terminal:</strong> Full PTY terminal powered by <strong>xterm.js</strong> and WebSockets directly in your browser.</li>\n<li><strong>Live Log Stream:</strong> Follow standard output and error streams of running containers.</li>\n<li><strong>Resource Metrics:</strong> Track CPU usage, RAM utilization, disk I/O, and network transfer.</li>\n</ul>"